<title>USA: Respironics oks share buyback plan.</title>
<headline>Respironics oks share buyback plan.</headline>
<dateline>MURRYSVILLE, Pa. 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Respironics Inc said on Wednesday it authorized the repurchase of up to five percent of the outstanding shares of the company's common stock.</p>
<p>The company said the repurchased common shares will be added to the company's treasury shares and may be used to meet common stock requirements of employee benefit plans, stock option plans and other corporate purposes.</p>
<p>Respironics manufactures and sells respiratory medical products for use in the home, hospitals, and in emergency care situations.  </p>
<p>The company had 21.2 million shares outstanding as of September 30, 1996.</p>
